Looking at this problem, I need to determine whether the maximal size $P(n)$ of a sparse subset of $\{1,\dots,n\}$ satisfies $P(n)/n \to 0$.

**Answer leak check:** The problem statement contains no leaked solutions or answer hints. Proceeding to solve.

